{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":21735,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":1994,"episodeCount":49,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zBWL8ws3iRxrFTTR7TAQw2B5aiV.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"599747","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Basara and his band \"Fire Bomber\" are a struggling up and coming group on the Macross 7, an intergalactic colony ship traveling through space looking for a new planet to call home. During one of their concerts, the colony is attacked by a mysterious enemy with an even more mysterious weapon that leaves its victoms in a catatonic state. Basara, yearning to have his music heard, flies into the battle zone in his Valkerie to spread the message of music.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sjuC5etFHYZrjMvO3r3jdeWBSEG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sjuC5etFHYZrjMvO3r3jdeWBSEG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"599748","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the crew and colonists of Macross 7 fleet deal with the threat of their mysterious new enemy, something return to business as usual. Aside from the constant threat of attack, now Mylene must deal with her mother Millia, who is also the Mayor of the city, and her plans for an arranged marriage for Mylene.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-10-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/imIScs853X7YAjU71mqzCDDIQfZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/imIScs853X7YAjU71mqzCDDIQfZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"599749","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene and Ray convince Basara that they should ent er the Super Nova Live show for new bands. Tentions rise between Max and Millia when they, as the two leaders of the fleet, get into an argument about the new threat while being interviewed. Macross 7 is attacked yet again, and much to the dismay of the defence forces, Basara flies into the fray to spread his music.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-10-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mZegIGf64K6w7rkeYv5Erk0mjqs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZegIGf64K6w7rkeYv5Erk0mjqs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"599750","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Fire Bomber performs a concert in the city. A new threat has infiltrated the city. All over the city, strange men with masks have been attacking people to steal their Spiritia. The defence force, the Diamond force in particular, protest Basara's constant interference during battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-11-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qsUWDUYhv92lPIoUkhm2HDBfbPi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsUWDUYhv92lPIoUkhm2HDBfbPi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"599751","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While performing at a gig on another ship in the fleet, Basara encounters a group of girl bike riders lead by a woman named Rex. The Varauta attacks the ship that they are on, and Basara flies into the battle again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-11-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xhZAbDIQhd944iCWyIoAHjgaYhE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xhZAbDIQhd944iCWyIoAHjgaYhE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"599762","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After constant pressure from her daughter, Millia agrees to let Mylene stay in the band. Millia, however makes one consession that Mylene go out on a date with Gamilin. Mylene is aprehensive, but agrees. Meanwhile, Gamilin tries to find out more about Basara and his Valkerie. As Basara and the band wait for their turn to play at the band competition, the fleet is attack yet again by Gigile and the mysterious fighter group.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-11-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lPoiC5xvGKLNmZWA6pNUU8SzYCb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lPoiC5xvGKLNmZWA6pNUU8SzYCb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"599763","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The band heads for the resort ship Riviera for a performance. After their performance and a quick swim, Mylene meets Gamilin for a date. All looks well but Gamilin is called into action when the ship is attacked. Basara and Mylene are trapped during the battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nH5LRVR9NqlXHZYG8ziC07jjgWN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nH5LRVR9NqlXHZYG8ziC07jjgWN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"599764","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Basara contemplates removing the missile system on his Valkerie.\n\nRay's friend Akiko buys a song Fire Bomber recorded on a hunch that it will become a hit. Gigil confronts Gepernich as to why they are wasting their time on small skirmishes when they could take the whole fleet in one big attack. Gepernich hints that what they learn from the humans could change everything.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/orLCnXA5oyowLVfdTgdA2AJtREv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/orLCnXA5oyowLVfdTgdA2AJtREv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"599765","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The band get its first taste of real succes when their song \"Planet Dance\" makes it to 194 on the top 200 list. Mylene meets famous singer Alice Holiday. The Varauta attack and take Alice's spiritia. The movation behind their attacks begin to be revealed when Gepernich cryptically mentions the \"Spiritia Farm Project\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9Pry7ZyCLT9BVixZUqXERsC1tyz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Pry7ZyCLT9BVixZUqXERsC1tyz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"599766","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ray takes Basara's Valkerie to the UN spacy for repair. Akiko tells Mylene about how she and Ray met and about his past as a fighter pilot. Ray is injured in a Varuata attack, but goes against doctor's orders to return Basara's Valkerie.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxQW4ARF4hP4o40fXQoWzrZKW8J.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxQW4ARF4hP4o40fXQoWzrZKW8J.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"599767","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene is casted as the lead in the \"Linn Minmei story\". Mylene is excited about the opportunity, but Basara is, of course, oblivious to this. Mylene's co-star, Bobby, tries to take advantage of her, but he is stopped when a Varauta soldier breaks into their hotel. With Bobby now in a Spiritia coma, Basara is forced to take over the co-staring role.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1994-12-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hASB34zFf0vu8McteiTMFxRIvX0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hASB34zFf0vu8McteiTMFxRIvX0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"599768","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene is kidnapped by a Varauta while on a date with Gamlin. When Basara and the band find out, they run out to go look for her. Gepernich is finally ready to launch the Spiritia Farm Project, and sends Gigile to attack City 7.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mvLnOIcP8zfVRMX48BEYGYV9SUA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mvLnOIcP8zfVRMX48BEYGYV9SUA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"599769","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the Macross 7 fleet search, City 7 de-folds in orbit of a strange planet. While the Varauta recharge the fold engines to rendezvous with Gepernich's fleet, Millia and Fire Bomber work to figure out a way to retake the city.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2WtHdaYExRxLSeGV4OLf6ej4be0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2WtHdaYExRxLSeGV4OLf6ej4be0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"599770","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Milia works with the others to repair the fold system, and to find a way to reunite with the fleet. The Varauta decide that Basara is a liability to their plans, and plot to have him assassinated.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yHT8d4JM6x5plKKr9z4J3c7A78V.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yHT8d4JM6x5plKKr9z4J3c7A78V.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"599771","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"To help with the moral in City 7 Milia arranges to have a \"Valkyrie Carnival\" where citizens can see old and new Valkyries and Destroids. Hoping to fortify the military, she also holds try outs where people can test their skills in Valkyrie simulators. Things get out of hand when a Varauta attack spills over into the Carnival.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/22I2iHQwEaoLQgpjmsrqxPRpMdt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22I2iHQwEaoLQgpjmsrqxPRpMdt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"599732","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene tinkers with Basara's Valkyrie, and insists that he teacher how to fight. Basara insists that there are other ways of doing things instead of fighting. Later, scientists on City 7 make a break through with the Captured Varauta Soldier.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCjMpJQqLuvoroNgjBsBbgrBhwb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCjMpJQqLuvoroNgjBsBbgrBhwb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"599733","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Against orders from Gepernich, Gigile travels to a frozen world and uses the Spiritia that he gathered to free a strange alien girl named Sivil. Hungering for more Spiritia, she flies off to City 7 where she begins to drain Spiritia from its fighter Pilots.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-02-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fk3fjmzHezcicEIppQPCh4Rp1V3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fk3fjmzHezcicEIppQPCh4Rp1V3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"599734","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ray is trying to figure out what is it about Basara's music that affects the comatose pilots. Meanwhile in space, Gepernich orders Sivil to retrieve City 7. She takes a fleet to attack City 7, but has her own agenda: to find out more about Basara, and why his music affects her the way it does.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pJK9XDC5356UNpHu5JCfxZSMwhs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pJK9XDC5356UNpHu5JCfxZSMwhs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"599735","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sivil starts to attack people inside City 7. However, when she hears Basara's music she begins to walk through the streets, and the presence causes the Zentrati to become violent. Elswhere in City 7, a group of terrorists break into the mayor's office, and take Milia hostage.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9eOsWWOp8P5nOIDhcFW3mfa1RSv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9eOsWWOp8P5nOIDhcFW3mfa1RSv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"599736","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Fame and battles are starting to take it's toll on Basara. The growing popularity of Fire Bomber starts to become more and more evident in City 7. Dokker, who has recovered from his Spiritia induced coma, has been assigned as the leader of the new, elite Emerald squad.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-03-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1rbXJ1KFuIcyNdmhYpTbGVgAnW2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1rbXJ1KFuIcyNdmhYpTbGVgAnW2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"599737","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Fire Bomber is in a studio recording their first album. Unknown to the band, Sivil has possessed Akiko, and tries to seduce Basara. Elsewhere, Max and the captains evaluate the new information gained from their captured Varauta pilot.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-03-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uIW9NgimFglFiL0h1pt77xpr7Pr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uIW9NgimFglFiL0h1pt77xpr7Pr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"599738","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"City 7 gets trapped in the magnetic pull of a nearby star. Milia, Basara and Gamilin do their best to save the city, but the gravitational pull is too strong. As City 7 teters on the edge of destruction, Gigil and the Varauta attack in a final attempt to capture the city.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-03-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sk0bfSdWl8NWITm4hXgGlBrNAci.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sk0bfSdWl8NWITm4hXgGlBrNAci.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"599739","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Fire Bomber puts on a concert to celebrate City 7's reunion with Battle 7 and the fleet. The concert is interupted when Sivil attacks and starts stealing spiritia from people in the crowd. Later, Max meets with Ray to discuss form a new squad called the \"Sound Force\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-03-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8DvoM3uroikgX61CcFpd0rKKpop.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8DvoM3uroikgX61CcFpd0rKKpop.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"599740","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Fire Bomber prepares for their \"Sound Force\" duties, Sivil for some reason is encased in a bubble hidden in a City 7 park. Gamilin is promoted to Lieutenant and given command of the Diamond squad. He requests being assigned to protecting the Sound Force, but instead is placed under the command of Millia, and charged with protecting the city.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-04-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p9V5oYzvq8bf9xnUOVXaL8g3723.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p9V5oYzvq8bf9xnUOVXaL8g3723.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"599741","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バサラたちは出撃に備えてバルキリーのフォーメーション訓練を始めるが、結果は思わしくなかった。そこで、バサラとベテランロックシンガーのアリスをデュエットさせることを思いつくレイとアキコ。それが成功すれば大ヒット、失敗しても“ファイアーボンバー”のチームワークがまとまるという一石二鳥の妙案だったが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-04-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v5k7TQXJh3YyNvhfghRYCg1S3GF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v5k7TQXJh3YyNvhfghRYCg1S3GF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"975546","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"マクロス5が移住した惑星ラクスの軌道上に到着したマクロス7。だが、いくら通信を送っても返事がないことを警戒したマックスは、安全が確認されるまで惑星への降下を禁止する。そんなことはお構いなしに、ラクスへと降下したバサラとミレーヌは、美しい自然の中に点在するマクロス5の残骸を見つけて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cwfHpbbrtWiFTHRIZ9DXzap3SRc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cwfHpbbrtWiFTHRIZ9DXzap3SRc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"599753","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Episodio 27","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"船団の修理が完了するまで、マクロス7は惑星ラクスに定住することになった。この状況下でDr.千葉は、歌エネルギーを発生させる“サウンドエナジーシステム”を開発する。その実験を兼ねたコンサートで、声の出ないバサラになり代わり装置を付けて歌うミレーヌ。そして、彼女はエネルギーを発生させるが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dDGhms5I4ECXX0koK3ye64hRW62.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dDGhms5I4ECXX0koK3ye64hRW62.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"599754","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"蘇ったプロトデビルンのグラビルがいつ攻撃してきても対処できるように、歌の練習をする“ファイアーボンバー”のメンバーたち。だが、バサラが練習をすっぽかしてしまった。そんな時、シビルを目覚めさせるにはバサラの歌しかないと考えたギギルが彼を誘惑する。そして、シビルの元に連れてこられたバサラは…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ma9kB4lnVf00AIulHQSThuoNCNo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ma9kB4lnVf00AIulHQSThuoNCNo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"599755","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene, tired of her parents fighting all the time, plots to get them together one last time.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vBQ5ANILnFGPnTTX2B6XVaWzA6I.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vBQ5ANILnFGPnTTX2B6XVaWzA6I.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"599756","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ゲペルニッチは、マインドコントロールしたマクロス5の兵士たちをガビルに部下として与えた。彼らを引き連れ、マクロス7を攻撃するガビル。その際、ガビルはこれまでの戦いで気づいた“サウンドフォース”の弱点を突く。だが、バサラの歌の前では効果を得られず、部下たちのマインドコントロールを解かれてしまい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/czJFSz7uVLI6ozTfLi8SzQlAivH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/czJFSz7uVLI6ozTfLi8SzQlAivH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"599757","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バサラのプライベートや過去がゴシップ誌のネタにされるようになった。そして、記者連中に追いかけ回されることになったバサラだったが、そんなことはお構いなしでシビルを目覚めさせようと奮戦する。その光景を陰から見守っていたギギルは、一向にシビルが目覚めないため、バサラにその怒りをぶつけて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zjnnE4JpZ31817yX2L2gHoBwiBt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjnnE4JpZ31817yX2L2gHoBwiBt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"599758","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"第2の遊撃隊“ジャミングバーズ”を誕生させるためのオーディションが開催された。その審査に加わるようにとバートン大佐から命令されるが、シビルを目覚めさせることに専念するバサラ。そして一次審査後、またしても大佐から最終選考の審査などを命令されたバサラは拒否してしまう。そんな彼の態度に、怒った大佐は…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/up7yyg8YG47a9aCyFT8JhmsZ2vv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/up7yyg8YG47a9aCyFT8JhmsZ2vv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"599759","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついにバサラの尾行に成功し、秘密の場所を突き止めたミレーヌ。だが、そこで彼女が目にしたものは、シティ7の市民を震撼させたシビルをバサラが目覚めさせようとしている光景だった。それに動揺したミレーヌは、マックスに相談する。そんな2人の会話を偶然立ち聞きしたバートン大佐は、シビルを捕獲して…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/alkZr6O3GaPJ1MR6gEhodXhSisU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/alkZr6O3GaPJ1MR6gEhodXhSisU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"599760","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シビルを自分の歌で目覚めさせることができなかったと、1人傷心の旅に出てしまったバサラ。その行動に責任を感じたミレーヌは、バサラに一言謝ろうとその後を追いかける。一方、シビルの目覚めに脅威を感じたゲペルニッチから、シビル抹殺の命を受けたガビル、バルゴ、グラビルは暴走するシビルを攻撃するが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ahPgY3th6Vpfwm7eoFVVYpiTQ5b.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ahPgY3th6Vpfwm7eoFVVYpiTQ5b.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"599761","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"歌エネルギー探知機を頼りに、バサラを探すミレーヌとガムリン。だが、この装置は相手が歌を歌わないと、反応を示さないという欠点があった。バサラが歌っている気配はなく、グババの特殊能力にも反応がないため、ミレーヌのイライラは増大する。そんな彼女の心中を察したのか、グババは単独でバサラを探しにいき…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDqyMT9laBQPC3Lxhg7y58tvZkR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDqyMT9laBQPC3Lxhg7y58tvZkR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"599772","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ミレーヌたちと合流したバサラだったが、夢の中にシビルが出てきたことによってまた1人で出かけてしまった。その途中、巨大な雲に覆われた場所へと導かれるかのように突入したバサラは、そこでシビルの姿を目撃する。その時、出くわしたバサラとギギルは、先を争うようにシビルの元へと駆けつけようとするが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/khmboXYPOGBoPEN4a93PEzb3B6C.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/khmboXYPOGBoPEN4a93PEzb3B6C.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"599773","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バサラとギギルの友情の賜物か、ようやくシビルが目覚めた。それと同時に謎の遺跡が出現し、バサラたちは光の玉に包まれて宇宙の彼方へと飛ばされてしまう。一方、この光景を目撃したガムリンから遺跡出現の報告を受けたバトル7では、宇宙統合軍の参謀であるエキセドルがその遺跡の調査に赴くことになり…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7pbX0aV7cvqIjQx1msxlYfbQnXA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7pbX0aV7cvqIjQx1msxlYfbQnXA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"599774","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シビルたちと光の玉に乗って銀河を見てきたことで自分が歌う本当の理由を悟ったバサラは、バンド活動を再開する。ところが、ゲペルニッチがスピリチアを確保するため、7万の艦隊をもってラクスを包囲し、マクロス7を封じ込める作戦に出た。一方、ガビルたちからシビルを守ろうとするギギルは、本体を覚醒させて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hUQKIaDCuC3yaoZ697YTg3Fc5ft.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hUQKIaDCuC3yaoZ697YTg3Fc5ft.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"599725","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バサラたちの戦闘を記録した素材を軍から大量に借りたアキコは、これまでの“ファイアーボンバー”の活躍を人々に知ってもらおうとビデオを編集していた。一方、バサラたちのバルキリーをメンテナンスしている最中に、ガビルがバトル7に攻撃を仕かけてきた。これに対し、バトル7は“ジャミングバーズ”を出動させて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mxJHpohm4jeekfR1sJ0LlhN2Kid.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mxJHpohm4jeekfR1sJ0LlhN2Kid.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"599726","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"プロトデビルンに対するマクロス7の市民の不安を取り除こうと、ミリアは軍の考えを明確にしてほしいとマックスに嘆願する。その要請に、マックスは対応策を協議するための会議を開く。そこへ、プロトデビルンと接触をもったバサラたちが呼ばれる。その中で、バサラは音楽でプロトデビルンと分かり合えることを話すが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lS4DFo9dh7U6YhCQpkScfZwWM3u.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lS4DFo9dh7U6YhCQpkScfZwWM3u.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"599727","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"“ファイアーボンバー”の前に、ミレーヌのファンと名乗るビリーという少年が現れた。だが、なれなれしく接してくる上に変な写真まで撮ったということで、ミレーヌは彼にファンであることが迷惑だと言ってしまう。それが勘違いだと分かったミレーヌは、謝るためにビリーが住む農場艦のサニーフラワーを訪れるが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/isPy9G2ypglDXAtGh4Whuxsbpw9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/isPy9G2ypglDXAtGh4Whuxsbpw9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"599728","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"プロトデビルンを封じ込めたアニマスピリチアと、歌エネルギーに何か関係があると考えたDr.千葉。そこで彼は、“サウンドフォース”にサウンドバリアーを発生させ、プロトデビルンを捕獲する作戦を立てる。そして、“サウンドフォース”は攻撃してきたグラビルとガビルを捕獲しようとするが、2体が合体してしまい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4VO2YRis0MUBjeQHuo3VazLVJe8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4VO2YRis0MUBjeQHuo3VazLVJe8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"599729","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"地球の統合軍本部からマクロス7に、プロトデビルンの本拠地とされるバロータ星系第4惑星を破壊せよとの特命が下った。そこでマックスは、自分が直接指揮した少数精鋭部隊による奇襲突撃作戦“オペレーションスターゲイザー”を立案する。この作戦にバサラやガムリンたちが志願するが、ミレーヌは外されて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hbakLxGV313OvC9b8Aq8JAFCV1Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hbakLxGV313OvC9b8Aq8JAFCV1Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"599730","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"第4惑星の周回軌道上にフォールドアウトしたマックス率いる精鋭部隊。そこで部隊別に別れたバルキリー隊がプロトデビルンの眠る洞窟へと出撃していく。だが、それを察知していたゲペルニッチがガビルたちを洞窟に配置していたため、各バルキリー隊は苦戦を強いられてしまう。そんな中、ガビルの攻撃でガムリンが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zBOYQRopKCMEujuzkpmrusQGVeU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zBOYQRopKCMEujuzkpmrusQGVeU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"599731","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バサラたちはゲペルニッチの策略にはまり、捕虜となってしまった。そこで彼らはゲペルニッチからスピリチアを提供すれば命は保証すると言われるが、ガムリンの死のショックから立ち直ったミレーヌの歌をバックに脱出劇を展開する。その中でバサラたちは、眠らされていた何万人ものマクロス5の市民を発見して…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ypu8Ekh2aUpsd0Ai6OCem4egYNJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ypu8Ekh2aUpsd0Ai6OCem4egYNJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"599742","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"マックスが立案した奇襲突撃作戦が失敗に終わり、前途多難のマクロス7。だが、マックスは敵の反応からアニマスピリチアとバサラの歌が関係あるとし、Dr.千葉たちに調査をさせる。そうした中、ガビルに体を乗っ取られたガムリンが次々に軍事施設を爆破し、それをやめさせようとするミレーヌを人質に取り…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/giUhB7JxIGanqW2ynAEeym8f4np.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/giUhB7JxIGanqW2ynAEeym8f4np.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"599743","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ゾムドとゴラムという2体のプロトデビルンを新たに目覚めさせたゲペルニッチ。そして、ゾムドたちはマクロス5の市民を人質に、マクロス7に攻撃を仕かけてきた。プロトデビルンを歌で食い止めようとする“サウンドフォース”。彼らの歌によってゾムドたちは弱まり、マクロス5の市民たちは蘇ったかに見えたのだが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A7z80YqKxRYh4wM3aqjyzFkUSeA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A7z80YqKxRYh4wM3aqjyzFkUSeA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"599744","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ガラスケースの中に横たわったバサラを見守るミレーヌたち。その中で、レイはバサラと出会った頃のことを思い出していた。一方、バロータ星系第4惑星では、ゲペルニッチの本体が覚醒し始めていた。ゲペルニッチを封じ込められるアニマスピリチアの持ち主であるバサラが歌えない今、その対抗手段としてDr.千葉は…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-09-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bdyK2h7yo0ODHP3Gp9DALeGGsLz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bdyK2h7yo0ODHP3Gp9DALeGGsLz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"599745","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ゲペルニッチの本体から伸びる無数の暗黒の触手は、まわりの惑星をも飲み込み始めた。その触手は、マクロス7にも伸びていく…。もはや、マクロス7はこのまま暗黒の中に飲み込まれるしかないのか？ 銀河中からスピリチアが奪われてしまうのか？ そして、もう2度とバサラは目覚めることはないのだろうか…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-09-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zIGcDFPXPMikYZEPTFmsY1cr6Fx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zIGcDFPXPMikYZEPTFmsY1cr6Fx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1/episode/49"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21735/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"13":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"14":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"15":{"checkedAt":1793475899492,"st